WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.340
Sequence analysis needs two things before LAG or
LEAD can make sense First

00:00:06.538 --> 00:00:12.678
define whose sequence you are analyzing with
PARTITION BY Second define

00:00:12.704 --> 00:00:18.221
the event order Then choose LAG for a previous value
or LEAD

00:00:18.247 --> 00:00:23.830
for a next value If the order is ambiguous the
sequence result

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:25.014
is ambiguous too
